#: ../../how-to/ledger-evidence.md:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid "If a term is unfamiliar, see the {doc}`Glossary </_generated/glossary>`."
msgstr ""
"Si algun terme no et resulta familiar, consulta el {doc}`Glossari "
"</_generated/glossary>`."

#: ../../how-to/ledger-evidence.md:102
msgid ""
"Before sharing command output with anyone, strip tax identifiers such as "
"your NIF, DNI, or NIE."
msgstr ""
"Abans de compartir la sortida d'una ordre amb ningú, elimina els "
"identificadors fiscals com ara el teu NIF, DNI o NIE."

